---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import portrait from '../assets/gallery/portrait.jpg';
---

<Layout title="About — Devin Alexander" description="The full story — where I started, what shaped my perspective, and what I believe about building things that matter.">
  <main>
    <section class="about-page">
      <div class="about-inner">

        <div class="about-hero">
          <div class="hero-image-wrap">
            <div class="hero-image-frame">
              <Image src={portrait} alt="Devin Alexander" widths={[400, 800]} format="webp" quality={85} loading="eager" class="hero-portrait" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-text">
            <span class="hero-tag">About</span>
            <h1 class="hero-name">Devin Alexander</h1>
            <p class="hero-identity">Builder, operator, and design-obsessed generalist.</p>
            <div class="hero-descriptors">
              <span class="desc teal">Marketing</span>
              <span class="desc-dot" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
              <span class="desc amber">Operations</span>
              <span class="desc-dot" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
              <span class="desc rust">Design & Dev</span>
              <span class="desc-dot" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
              <span class="desc gold">GTM</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="story">
          <div class="story-tag"><span class="tag-number">01</span><span class="tag-dash" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="tag-label">Story</span></div>
          <p class="story-text story-lead">
            <span class="drop-cap">I</span> didn't set out to be a generalist. It happened because I kept saying yes to problems that interested me — regardless of what department they lived in. Marketing led to operations. Operations led to design. Design led to product. And somewhere along the way, I realized <span class="story-accent">the walls between disciplines were mostly imaginary.</span>
          </p>
          <p class="story-text">
            My career started in digital advertising at sixteen, running Google Ads from my bedroom in England. That systematic, "if this, then that" logic became my foundation. But over the next decade — across agencies, startups, and enterprises — I learned that the real world is messier than any framework. <span class="story-accent">The best results come from people who can hold multiple disciplines in their head at once</span> and find the leverage points between them.
          </p>
          <p class="story-text">
            I've scaled a startup from <span class="story-stat">$30K to $300K</span> a month. I've led marketing for a firm with <span class="story-stat">40+ Fortune 500</span> clients. I've built teams, rebranded companies, designed platforms, and shipped products. But the throughline isn't any single skill — it's the ability to see systems where others see silos, and to move between strategy and execution without losing altitude on either.
          </p>
          <p class="story-text">
            Today, I'm COO at Andreou Enterprises, operating across the portfolio and leading a team in the Web3 space. I'm also building tools on the side — because I believe <span class="story-accent">the best operators are the ones who never stop building.</span>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="convictions">
          <div class="convictions-tag"><span class="tag-number">02</span><span class="tag-dash" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="tag-label">Beliefs</span></div>
          <h2 class="convictions-heading">What I Believe</h2>

          <div class="conviction-grid">
            <article class="conviction">
              <span class="conviction-number">01</span>
              <h3 class="conviction-title">The best work lives at the intersections</h3>
              <p class="conviction-text">Specialization is a trap for most people. The world rewards those who can connect dots across disciplines — marketing that understands product, design that understands business, operations that understands people.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="conviction">
              <span class="conviction-number">02</span>
              <h3 class="conviction-title">Craft is a competitive advantage</h3>
              <p class="conviction-text">In a world of templates and shortcuts, caring about the details — the copy, the spacing, the user experience — is one of the few remaining moats. Taste compounds.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="conviction">
              <span class="conviction-number">03</span>
              <h3 class="conviction-title">Systems over heroics</h3>
              <p class="conviction-text">The goal isn't to be the person who saves the day. It's to build systems so good that the day never needs saving. Repeatable processes beat one-time sprints every time.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="conviction">
              <span class="conviction-number">04</span>
              <h3 class="conviction-title">Ship, then polish</h3>
              <p class="conviction-text">Perfectionism is procrastination in disguise. The fastest path to great work is shipping good work, learning what's missing, and iterating with real feedback.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="skills">
          <div class="skills-tag"><span class="tag-number">03</span><span class="tag-dash" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="tag-label">Focus</span></div>
          <h2 class="skills-heading">Areas of Focus</h2>
          <div class="skills-grid">
            <div class="skill-group">
              <h3 class="group-label">Marketing</h3>
              <ul class="skill-list">
                <li>GTM Strategy</li>
                <li>Brand & Positioning</li>
                <li>Content & Thought Leadership</li>
                <li>Email & Cold Outreach</li>
                <li>Paid Acquisition</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="skill-group">
              <h3 class="group-label">Operations</h3>
              <ul class="skill-list">
                <li>Team Leadership</li>
                <li>Process Design</li>
                <li>Automation & Workflows</li>
                <li>Data Analysis</li>
                <li>Vendor Management</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="skill-group">
              <h3 class="group-label">Design</h3>
              <ul class="skill-list">
                <li>UI/UX Design</li>
                <li>Brand Identity</li>
                <li>Web Design</li>
                <li>Design Systems</li>
                <li>Typography</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="skill-group">
              <h3 class="group-label">Technical</h3>
              <ul class="skill-list">
                <li>Front-End Development</li>
                <li>CMS Architecture</li>
                <li>API Integrations</li>
                <li>Analytics & Tracking</li>
                <li>No-Code Platforms</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="closing-cta">
          <p class="cta-text">If any of this resonates, <a href="/contact" class="cta-link">let's talk</a>.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="page-footer">
          <a href="/" class="back-link">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M13 7H1M6 2L1 7l5 5" />
            </svg>
            Back home
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<script>
  import { animate, inView, stagger } from 'motion';

  const sections = document.querySelectorAll('.about-hero, .story, .convictions, .skills, .closing-cta');
  sections.forEach(s => { s.style.opacity = '0'; });

  sections.forEach((el, i) => {
    inView(el, () => {
      animate(el, { opacity: [0, 1], y: [12, 0] }, {
        duration: 0.4,
        delay: i === 0 ? 0 : 0.05,
        easing: [0.25, 1, 0.5, 1],
      });
    }, { amount: 0.15 });
  });

  // Stagger conviction cards
  const convictions = document.querySelectorAll('.conviction');
  convictions.forEach(c => { c.style.opacity = '0'; });
  const convGrid = document.querySelector('.conviction-grid');
  if (convGrid) {
    inView(convGrid, () => {
      animate(convictions, { opacity: [0, 1], y: [12, 0] }, {
        duration: 0.35,
        delay: stagger(0.05),
        easing: [0.25, 1, 0.5, 1],
      });
    }, { amount: 0.2 });
  }

  // Spring hover on conviction cards — lift + shift title
  convictions.forEach(card => {
    card.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => {
      const title = card.querySelector('.conviction-title');
      animate(card, { y: -4 }, { duration: 0.15, easing: [0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1] });
      if (title) animate(title, { x: 3 }, { duration: 0.15, easing: [0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1] });
    });
    card.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {
      const title = card.querySelector('.conviction-title');
      animate(card, { y: 0 }, { duration: 0.25, easing: [0.16, 1, 0.3, 1] });
      if (title) animate(title, { x: 0 }, { duration: 0.25, easing: [0.16, 1, 0.3, 1] });
    });
  });

  // Stagger skill groups
  const skillGroups = document.querySelectorAll('.skill-group');
  skillGroups.forEach(g => { g.style.opacity = '0'; });
  const skillsGrid = document.querySelector('.skills-grid');
  if (skillsGrid) {
    inView(skillsGrid, () => {
      animate(skillGroups, { opacity: [0, 1], y: [12, 0] }, {
        duration: 0.35,
        delay: stagger(0.05),
        easing: [0.25, 1, 0.5, 1],
      });
    }, { amount: 0.2 });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .about-page {
    min-height: 100dvh;
    padding: var(--space-page-top) var(--space-page-x) var(--space-page-bottom);
    background: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .about-inner {
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ---- Section tags (reusable) ---- */
  .story-tag, .convictions-tag, .skills-tag {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-bottom: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
  }

  .tag-number {
    font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.4vw, 1.15rem);
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--color-accent-teal);
  }

  .convictions-tag .tag-number { color: var(--color-accent-amber); }
  .skills-tag .tag-number { color: var(--color-accent-rust); }

  .tag-dash {
    width: 24px;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-accent-teal), transparent);
  }

  .convictions-tag .tag-dash { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-accent-amber), transparent); }
  .skills-tag .tag-dash { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-accent-rust), transparent); }

  .tag-label {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  /* ---- Hero ---- */
  .about-hero {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-block-lg);
  }

  .hero-image-wrap {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: clamp(140px, 22vw, 220px);
  }

  .hero-image-frame {
    position: relative;
    padding: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--color-accent-teal), var(--color-accent), var(--color-accent-amber), var(--color-accent-rust));
  }

  .hero-image-frame :global(img) {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    filter: grayscale(0.3) sepia(0.1) brightness(0.95) contrast(1.05);
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .hero-tag {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent-teal);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .hero-name {
    font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5.5vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 0.65rem;
  }

  .hero-identity {
    font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.15rem);
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }

  .hero-descriptors {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5em;
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .desc.teal { color: var(--color-accent-teal); }
  .desc.amber { color: var(--color-accent-amber); }
  .desc.rust { color: var(--color-accent-rust); }
  .desc.gold { color: var(--color-accent); }
  .desc-dot { color: var(--color-text-muted); opacity: 0.4; font-size: 1.1em; }

  /* ---- Story ---- */
  .story {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-block-lg);
  }

  .story-text {
    font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1.8vw, 1.3rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .story-text:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .story-accent {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .story-stat {
    color: var(--color-accent-amber);
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .drop-cap {
    float: left;
    font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 3.8em;
    line-height: 0.75;
    padding-right: 0.08em;
    padding-top: 0.06em;
    color: var(--color-accent-teal);
  }

  /* ---- Convictions ---- */
  .convictions {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-block-lg);
  }

  .convictions-heading {
    font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }

  .conviction-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-element);
  }

  .conviction {
    padding: var(--space-card);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-text-muted) 12%, transparent);
    border-top: 2px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-accent-teal) 30%, transparent);
    transition: border-top-color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .conviction:nth-child(2) { border-top-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-accent-amber) 30%, transparent); }
  .conviction:nth-child(3) { border-top-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-accent-rust) 30%, transparent); }
  .conviction:nth-child(4) { border-top-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-accent) 30%, transparent); }

  .conviction:nth-child(1):hover { border-top-color: var(--color-accent-teal); }
  .conviction:nth-child(2):hover { border-top-color: var(--color-accent-amber); }
  .conviction:nth-child(3):hover { border-top-color: var(--color-accent-rust); }
  .conviction:nth-child(4):hover { border-top-color: var(--color-accent); }

  .conviction-number {
    font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
    line-height: 1;
    opacity: 0.08;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .conviction:nth-child(1) .conviction-number { color: var(--color-accent-teal); }
  .conviction:nth-child(2) .conviction-number { color: var(--color-accent-amber); }
  .conviction:nth-child(3) .conviction-number { color: var(--color-accent-rust); }
  .conviction:nth-child(4) .conviction-number { color: var(--color-accent); }

  .conviction-title {
    font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1.8vw, 1.25rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .conviction-text {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(0.88rem, 1.1vw, 0.95rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ---- Skills ---- */
  .skills {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-block-lg);
  }

  .skills-heading {
    font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }

  .skills-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-element);
  }

  .skill-group {
    padding: var(--space-card);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-text-muted) 10%, transparent);
    border-top: 2px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-accent-teal) 25%, transparent);
    transition: border-top-color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .skill-group:nth-child(2) { border-top-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-accent-amber) 25%, transparent); }
  .skill-group:nth-child(3) { border-top-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-accent-rust) 25%, transparent); }
  .skill-group:nth-child(4) { border-top-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-accent-teal) 25%, transparent); }

  .skill-group:hover { border-top-color: var(--color-accent-teal); }
  .skill-group:nth-child(2):hover { border-top-color: var(--color-accent-amber); }
  .skill-group:nth-child(3):hover { border-top-color: var(--color-accent-rust); }
  .skill-group:nth-child(4):hover { border-top-color: var(--color-accent-teal); }

  .group-label {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .skill-group:nth-child(1) .group-label { color: var(--color-accent-teal); }
  .skill-group:nth-child(2) .group-label { color: var(--color-accent-amber); }
  .skill-group:nth-child(3) .group-label { color: var(--color-accent-rust); }
  .skill-group:nth-child(4) .group-label { color: var(--color-accent-teal); }

  .skill-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .skill-list li {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(0.82rem, 1.1vw, 0.9rem);
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  /* ---- CTA ---- */
  .closing-cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding: var(--space-block) 0;
  }

  .cta-text {
    font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.5vw, 1.8rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .cta-link {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    text-decoration-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-accent) 40%, transparent);
    transition: text-decoration-color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .cta-link:hover {
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  /* ---- Footer ---- */
  .page-footer {
    margin-top: var(--space-block-lg);
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-text-muted) 15%, transparent);
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .back-link svg {
    transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .back-link:hover svg {
    transform: translateX(-3px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .conviction-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .skills-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .about-hero {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .hero-image-wrap {
      width: 160px;
    }

    .skills-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
